@baseUrl = http://localhost:5079

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/product/search
Accept: application/json

### category dan harga
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/product/search?minPrice=10000
Accept: application/json

### pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/product/search?page=1&pageSize=10&sort=price_desc&maxPrice=50000
Accept: application/json